<figure class="guide-figure" aria-label="Three separate kinds of LSU access">
<dl class="guide-accounts">
<div><dt>Preview access</dt><dd><strong>Shared username and password</strong><span>Unlocks the race website and this guide.</span><a href="/getting-started#choose-the-right-sign-in">Enter the preview</a></dd></div>
<div><dt>Training account</dt><dd><strong>Your LSU email and password</strong><span>Opens your training, messages and permitted workspaces.</span><a href="/my-account">Manage training access</a></dd></div>
<div><dt>Race-entry account</dt><dd><strong>Your separate race Profile</strong><span>Holds race applications and confirmation tasks.</span><a href="/races#request-a-place">Request a race place</a></dd></div>
</dl>
<figcaption>Signing into one does not sign you into the others. Buying training does not enter you in a race.</figcaption>
</figure>
